## Step 2 — Establish the Iteration Goal by Selecting Drivers

**Iteration Goal:** Design the internal component architecture for all modules involved in the six use cases, with particular focus on the price change flow (HPS-2), price query flow (HPS-3), and authentication flow (HPS-1), ensuring the design supports QA-1 (100ms), QA-4 (1M queries/day), and QA-5 (hotel-level authorization).

**Driver Subset Selected:**
- HPS-1, HPS-2, HPS-3, HPS-4, HPS-5, HPS-6 (all use cases)
