## Step 5 — Instantiate Architectural Elements, Allocate Responsibilities, and Define Interfaces

### A. Price Calculation Module — Internal Components

```
Price Calculation Module
├── PriceChangeCommandConsumer    — Kafka consumer for "price-change-commands" topic
├── PriceChangeValidator          — Validates input (hotel exists, dates valid, user authorized)
├── PriceSimulator                — Calculates proposed prices WITHOUT persisting (HPS-2 simulation)
├── RateCalculationEngine         — Executes business rules for rate calculations (HPS-5)
├── PriceChangeApplier            — Persists price changes to write_model schema
├── PriceEventPublisher           — Publishes events to "price-change-events" topic
├── SimulationResultCache         — Caches simulation results for user review
└── RateRuleRepository            — Reads/stores rate calculation business rules
```

**Component Responsibilities:**

| Component | Responsibility | Input | Output |
|-----------|---------------|-------|--------|
| `PriceChangeCommandConsumer` | Consumes commands from Kafka, routes to simulation or application path | Kafka message (price-change-commands) | Internal method calls |
| `PriceChangeValidator` | Validates hotel exists, dates are valid, user is authorized for hotel | Price change request | Validation result |
| `PriceSimulator` | Calls `RateCalculationEngine` with proposed changes; returns proposed prices WITHOUT writing to DB | Proposed rate changes | Simulated price results |
| `RateCalculationEngine` | Executes business rules to calculate all dependent rates from base/fixed rates | Rate change + business rules | Calculated prices for all rate/room/date combos |
| `PriceChangeApplier` | Persists validated price changes to write_model schema in PostgreSQL | Validated price changes | DB write confirmation |
| `PriceEventPublisher` | Publishes price change events to Kafka "price-change-events" topic | Price change data | Kafka event |
| `SimulationResultCache` | Temporarily stores simulation results for user review (in-memory, TTL-based) | Simulated prices | Cached results by tracking ID |
